flowchart TD
    A[Start Training] --> B{CUDA available?}
    B -->|Yes| C1[Initialize NCCLBackend]
    B -->|No| C2[Initialize MPIBackend]

    C1 --> D[Random.seed! 42 on all ranks]
    C2 --> D

    D --> E[Create identical global dataset]
    E --> F[Shard via DistributedDataContainer]
    F --> G[Initialize model weights]
    G --> H[Sync model: broadcast from rank 0]
    H --> I[Setup DistributedOptimizer]
    I --> J[Sync optimizer state: broadcast from rank 0]

    J --> K[Epoch Loop]
    subgraph EPOCH[For Each Epoch]
        K --> L[Batch Loop]
        subgraph BATCH[For Each Batch]
            L --> M{rank == 0?}
            M -->|use_head_a=true| N1[Forward: Head A]
            M -->|use_head_a=false| N2[Forward: Head B]
            N1 --> O[Compute loss]
            N2 --> O
            O --> P[Backward via Zygote]
            P --> Q[resolve_unused_parameters!!]
            Q --> R[Optimisers.update - auto allreduce]
            R --> L
        end
        R --> S[Validation Loop]
        subgraph VAL[Validation]
            S --> T[Forward pass only, no grad]
            T --> U[AllReduce val loss]
            U --> V[Rank 0 prints val loss]
        end
        V --> W[Rank 0 prints train loss]
        W --> K
    end

    K --> X[Training complete]
    X --> Y[Rank 0 saves checkpoint JLD2]
    Y --> Z[End]
